integ5 0071 = patches/pdl5/0069-glm-pdl-p2p-gather.patch (overnight 2026-10-31), renumbered for the integrated stack on 3f94715d.

pdl5 0069: the P2P all-gather waits, lets the next grid launch, then exchanges (TF_GLM_PDL_CHAIN's p2p).
- glm_glue_p2p.cuh: tf_glm_p2p_gather calls pdl_wait (for the grid that wrote mine, and so every earlier one) before it
  touches memory, then pdl_trigger, then the unchanged exchange: flags, fences, parities, epoch and abort/timeout.
  Its dependents (hc_post) still wait for it to complete before they read the gathered rows.
- p2p_gather.zig: Gather.pdl (default false) on the launch; cuda_p2p.zig sets it from the chain after open.
Needs 0068 (pdl_wait in glm_triton.cuh) and 0067 (Chain). Exact by construction.

